{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Tonewheel organ with upper and lower manuals, pedals, percussion, vibrato/chorus scanner, overdrive, reverb and a rotary speaker, ported from setBfree by Fredrik Kilander, Robin Gareus, Ken Restivo and Will Panther https://github.com/pantherb/setBfree (GPLv2+) JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license Claude generated some of this code\par}
