{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Simple piano-like synth with minimal controls, playable from an 88-key on-screen keyboard or the computer keyboard, with a MIDI channel filter. The Tolerable sound (the first screen) is ported from Ardour's ACE Reasonable Synth by Robin Gareus https://github.com/Ardour/ardour/tree/master/libs/plugins/reasonablesynth.lv2 (GPLv2+) Everything else is original to this plugin by chmaha: the mystery sound that changes a little every day, the six keyboard games and the December lights (click them to play the Jingle Bells chorus, click again to stop). JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license Claude generated some of this code\par}
}

