{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 VU meter with adjustable nominal level, rise and decay speed, and mono or stereo display. Click the meter to open or close the settings panel. Ported from unplugred's VU (https://github.com/unplugred/vsts), AGPLv3+. Image asset by unplugred, CC BY-NC (see Dependencies/VU/VU-LICENSE.txt). Claude Sonnet 5.x was involved in the porting of the DSP and GUI JSFX code released under AGPLv3+ license\par}
}

